WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.125
Describe family roles and appreciate helpful community members

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:09.532
Family commitment: doing fair duties and supporting family members. Community helper:

00:00:09.532 --> 00:00:12.865
a person who serves others in a neighbourhood.

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:18.082
Cooperation: working together to achieve a shared goal. Responsibility: finishing

00:00:18.082 --> 00:00:23.779
tasks that are suitable for your age. Kindness: offering help without expecting a

00:00:23.779 --> 00:00:24.217
reward.

00:00:25.033 --> 00:00:29.663
Interview a trusted adult about one family duty and one community service.
